Description: Provides an end-to-end pipeline for processing RNA, 
    DNA methylation, and chromatin accessibility data at the single-cell level. 
    It features ultra-fast data aggregation, quality control, dimensionality reduction, 
    and multi-omics integration based on genomic regions. Additionally, it offers 
    extensive publication-ready visualization tools for downstream analysis.
